  ProjectName: Script Dependency Viewer
  ClientName: Unity Store
  Tags: 16
  Texts:
  - category: 0
    info: Unity Developer
  - category: 2
    info: 'Script Dependency Viewer is a Unity Editor tool that draws an interactive
      map of every C# script in a project''s Assets folder. Each script is a movable,
      clickable node showing its name and namespace, laid out in a drag-and-zoom
      workspace.

      

      Nodes can be coloured, edited live and used to
      jump straight to the code, which makes large or modular projects much easier
      to understand and maintain.'
  - category: 9
    info: '- A custom Editor window with a pannable, zoomable canvas.

      - Automatic
      discovery of all scripts in the project, with name and namespace parsing.

      -
      Node interactions: drag, select, colour-code and navigate to the script.

      -
      Packaging and submission to the Unity Asset Store, following its publishing
      guidelines.'
